<section image-layout="blank" id="RuwL2MW5Yj" background-color="heading"><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item id="m2L_NYyRC5" colspan="30"><p role="eyebrow">Studio method · Closing exercise</p><h1 font-size="34pt">One message.<br/>Three behaviors.<br/>Five questions.</h1><p font-size="18pt">Keep the communicative intent constant. Change the medium, then document how roles and consequences change.</p><table borders="rows" striped="false" header-row="false" header-col="false" col-widths="[39,61]" style="--table-cell-padding-block: 7pt; --table-cell-padding-inline: 0pt;"><tr><td><b>Print · Fixed</b></td><td>Resolve one stable edition.</td></tr><tr><td><b>Interactive · Linked</b></td><td>Design states and responses.</td></tr><tr><td><b>Generative · Variable</b></td><td>Bound variation and evaluate outputs.</td></tr></table></grid-item><grid-item id="V7pqXhck1T" colspan="30"><p role="eyebrow">Critique before choosing the medium</p><grid divider="sm palette-5" marker="number" marker-style="solid" marker-shape="circle" marker-position="inline" marker-numbering-format="decimal-leading-zero" direction="vertical" vertical-sizing="hug" style="--marker-inline-size: 32pt; --marker-gap: 14pt;"><grid-item id="YmjjUfUnn7" padding="8pt 0"><h4>What is fixed, and what can vary?</h4></grid-item><grid-item id="U23H7TYI6S" padding="8pt 0"><h4>Who can make, publish, revise, and respond?</h4></grid-item><grid-item id="Crkrh5ADLA" padding="8pt 0"><h4>How does the work travel?</h4></grid-item><grid-item id="_KJ2PsOLlh" padding="8pt 0"><h4>Where are decisions visible or hidden?</h4></grid-item><grid-item id="4j2f_RVD3P" padding="8pt 0"><h4>What does the interface ask the audience to become?</h4></grid-item></grid><spacer mode="fixed" size="14pt"></spacer><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="tyeykGgh8V" background-color="accent" padding="14pt 18pt"><p font-size="18pt"><b>Final test:</b> if only the surface changed, the medium has not yet been redesigned.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>